      ],
      "message": "bitcoin-tx: reject outscript with too many separators\n\noutscript takes VALUE:SCRIPT[:FLAGS], but the flags are only read when\nthere are exactly three fields. With an extra ':' the flags are\nsilently ignored, so `outscript=0:1:S:` produces a bare script output\ninstead of the requested P2SH (or P2WSH for W) and exits 0.\n\nReject more than three fields with an error.",
